47	For MC-format benchmarks where guessing and ceiling effects are non-negligible, we extend to:
48	\begin{equation}
49	    P(y_{ijk} = 1) = c_i + (d_i - c_i)\,\sigma\!\bigl(a_i(\theta_j - b_i) + \gamma_k \cdot e_{ij}\bigr),
